{"id":70510,"date":"2026-10-23T08:53:32","date_gmt":"2026-10-23T07:53:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70510"},"modified":"2026-10-23T08:55:02","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T07:55:02","slug":"trail-vilarinho-de-cima","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-vilarinho-de-cima\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Vilarinho Cima 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Vilarinho Cima 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Vilarinho Cima 2027<\/strong> (5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 V Trail Vilarinho Cima) realiza-se no dia <strong>7 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong> (domingo), na freguesia de <strong>Gandra<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Paredes<\/strong> (distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>). Com partidas e chegadas junto \u00e0s instala\u00e7\u00f5es da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Recreativa de Vilarinho de Cima<\/strong>, na Rua Alberto Coelho Moreira, esta prova integra o Circuito Distrital de Trail Running da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Porto (AAP).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Limitado a 700 vagas, o evento apresenta tr\u00eas desafios distintos pelos trilhos e serras de Gandra: o <strong>Trail (21 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini Trail (13 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s <strong>09:20<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada (8 km)<\/strong> n\u00e3o competitiva \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong>. O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de <strong>4h00<\/strong> (com barramento hor\u00e1rio \u00e0s 11:15 no \u00faltimo posto de controlo), sendo obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua e copo pr\u00f3prio nos abastecimentos.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>Grupo Desportivo da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Vilarinho Cima<\/strong>, o evento inclui T-shirt oficial, medalha finisher, dorsal com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos e servi\u00e7o de banhos nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Vilarinho Cima, encerrando com a cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios a partir das 12:30. Explora tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio das melhores <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Meias Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e prepara a tua prova na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo (Pace)<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/s