;\">\ud83d\udcc5 7 de Fevereiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 8,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (1 Out a 31 Dez)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 8,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (1 Jan a 2 Fev)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Vilarinho Cima 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O V Trail Vilarinho Cima realiza-se no domingo, 7 de fevereiro de 2027, com partida e chegada nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Recreativa de Vilarinho de Cima (Rua Alberto Coelho Moreira, 229, coordenadas GPS 41.17800, -8.43163), na freguesia de Gandra, concelho de Paredes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, hor\u00e1rios de partida e vagas dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disp\u00f5e de 700 vagas distribu\u00eddas por tr\u00eas provas: Trail de 21 km (partida \u00e0s 09:00, controlo zero \u00e0s 08:45, 200 vagas), Mini Trail de 13 km (partida \u00e0s 09:20, controlo zero \u00e0s 09:15, 300 vagas) e Caminhada de 8 km n\u00e3o competitiva (partida \u00e0s 09:30, 200 vagas).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">De 1 de outubro a 31 de dezembro (1\u00aa fase) os valores s\u00e3o de 16,00 \u20ac (Trail 21 km), 13,00 \u20ac (Mini Trail 13 km) e 8,00 \u20ac (Caminhada 8 km). De 1 de janeiro a 2 de fevereiro (2\u00aa fase) passam para 18,00 \u20ac (Trail 21 km), 15,00 \u20ac (Mini Trail 13 km) e 8,00 \u20ac (Caminhada 8 km). A cada 10 inscritos na vertente trail \u00e9 oferecida 1 inscri\u00e7\u00e3o. Inclui dorsal, T-shirt, seguro, abastecimentos, medalha finisher e duches.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios funciona o secretariado para entrega de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Vilarinho Cima (Rua Alberto Coelho Moreira, 229, Gandra) no s\u00e1bado (6 de fevereiro) das 10:00 \u00e0s 12:30 e das 14:00 \u00e0s 18:00, e no domingo (7 de fevereiro, dia da prova) das 07:00 \u00e0s 08:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de 4h00, com barramento hor\u00e1rio \u00e0s 11:15 no \u00faltimo posto de controlo de cada prova. Todos os participantes (Trail 21 km, Mini Trail 13 km e Caminhada 8 km) devem transportar obrigatoriamente telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua e copo pr\u00f3prio, j\u00e1 que n\u00e3o s\u00e3o fornecidos copos nos abastecimentos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Vilarinho Cima 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-07\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Vilarinho Cima, Rua Alberto Coelho Moreira, 229, Gandra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Paredes\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail Vilarinho Cima 2027 realiza-se a 7 de fevereiro em Gandra, Paredes. Provas de Trail 21 km, Mini Trail 13 km e Caminhada 8 km. Garante j\u00e1 o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-vilarinho-de-cima.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail 21 km\", \"price\": \"16.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/trail_vilarinho_cima_2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini Trail 13 km\", \"price\": \"13.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/trail_vilarinho_cima_2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 8 km\", \"price\": \"8.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/trail_vilarinho_cima_2027\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Grupo Desportivo da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Vilarinho Cima\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Vilarinho Cima 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O V Trail Vilarinho Cima realiza-se no domingo, 7 de fevereiro de 2027, com partida e chegada nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Recreativa de Vilarinho de Cima (Rua Alberto Coelho Moreira, 229, coordenadas GPS 41.17800, -8.43163), na freguesia de Gandra, concelho de Paredes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, hor\u00e1rios de partida e vagas dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento disp\u00f5e de 700 vagas distribu\u00eddas por tr\u00eas provas: Trail de 21 km (partida \u00e0s 09:00, controlo zero \u00e0s 08:45, 200 vagas), Mini Trail de 13 km (partida \u00e0s 09:20, controlo zero \u00e0s 09:15, 300 vagas) e Caminhada de 8 km n\u00e3o competitiva (partida \u00e0s 09:30, 200 vagas).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"De 1 de outubro a 31 de dezembro (1\u00aa fase) os valores s\u00e3o de 16,00 \u20ac (Trail 21 km), 13,00 \u20ac (Mini Trail 13 km) e 8,00 \u20ac (Caminhada 8 km). De 1 de janeiro a 2 de fevereiro (2\u00aa fase) passam para 18,00 \u20ac (Trail 21 km), 15,00 \u20ac (Mini Trail 13 km) e 8,00 \u20ac (Caminhada 8 km). A cada 10 inscritos na vertente trail \u00e9 oferecida 1 inscri\u00e7\u00e3o. Inclui dorsal, T-shirt, seguro, abastecimentos, medalha finisher e duches.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios funciona o secretariado para entrega de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Vilarinho Cima (Rua Alberto Coelho Moreira, 229, Gandra) no s\u00e1bado (6 de fevereiro) das 10:00 \u00e0s 12:30 e das 14:00 \u00e0s 18:00, e no domingo (7 de fevereiro, dia da prova) das 07:00 \u00e0s 08:15.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de 4h00, com barramento hor\u00e1rio \u00e0s 11:15 no \u00faltimo posto de controlo de cada prova. Todos os participantes (Trail 21 km, Mini Trail 13 km e Caminhada 8 km) devem transportar obrigatoriamente telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua e copo pr\u00f3prio, j\u00e1 que n\u00e3o s\u00e3o fornecidos copos nos abastecimentos.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70511,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-70510","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-paredes-porto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-vilarinho-de-cima-746x1024.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/70510","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=70510"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/70510\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70514,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/70510\/revisions\/70514"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/70511"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=70510"}],"wp:term":[{"